{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumUniverses.FrobeniusPairingExists","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumUniverses.FrobeniusPairingExists","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CategoricalFoundations"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.frobeniusForm_exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.frobeniusForm_exists","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L86-L107","doc":"**Existence of the non-degenerate Frobenius pairing on a quantum\nuniverse.**\n\nEvery `QuantumUniverse k` carries Frobenius–Hopf data `qu.frobHopf`;\n`FrobeniusHopfData.nonDegeneratePairing` constructs from it the pairing\nmorphism `∫_A ∘ μ` *and* a coevaluation for which both snake identities\nhold — i.e. the pairing exists in `𝐂` and is non-degenerate (its\nadjoint `A → A∨` is an isomorphism).\n\nThis is strictly stronger than the previous `Nonempty (FrobeniusHopfData …)`\nstub, which only re-asserted that the data exists; here the *pairing\nmorphism and its non-degeneracy* are produced. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:frobenius-pairing-exists","label":"prop:frobenius-pairing-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.nonDegeneratePairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FrobeniusHopfData.nonDegeneratePairing","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L69-L84","doc":"**Construction of the non-degenerate Frobenius pairing from the\nFrobenius–Hopf data.**\n\nThe pairing is `μ ≫ λ`; the snake identities are exactly the\n`pairing_snake_left` / `pairing_snake_right` fields of `fh` (which are\nphrased in terms of `mul ≫ frobeniusForm`), so they hold by `rfl`-level\nrewriting of `pairing_eq`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.snake_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.snake_right","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Snake identity (right) for this pairing — non-degeneracy, half two. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.snake_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.snake_left","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Snake identity (left) for this pairing — non-degeneracy, half one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.coevaluation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.coevaluation","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The dual coevaluation `η̃ : 𝟙 → A ⊗ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.pairing_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.pairing_eq","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L55-L55","doc":"It is the canonical Frobenius pairing `∫_A ∘ μ = μ ≫ λ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.pairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.pairing","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The pairing morphism `⟨·,·⟩ : A ⊗ A → 𝟙`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.NonDegenerateFrobeniusPairing","kind":"structure","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-pairing-exists.lean#L43-L67","doc":"**The non-degenerate Frobenius pairing of a Frobenius–Hopf object.**\n\nA morphism `pairing : A ⊗ A → 𝟙` together with a coevaluation\n`η̃ : 𝟙 → A ⊗ A` witnessing non-degeneracy through the two snake\nidentities.  This is the categorical content of \"the Frobenius\npairing exists and its adjoint `A → A∨` is an isomorphism\". ","signatureChunk":0}]}